WEBVTT

00:27.318 --> 00:28.528
Glow.

00:31.031 --> 00:36.036
(I Was Reincarnated as the 7th Prince so I Can Take
My Time Perfecting My Magical Ability 2nd Season)

00:36.578 --> 00:40.790
(Episode 24: In the Light)

00:43.293 --> 00:46.296
Oh, I didn't expect you would block that.

00:46.838 --> 00:49.299
Could it actually be effective on you?

00:50.425 --> 00:54.011
<i>In that case, I might be able to
brute force him into becoming a good guy,</i>

00:54.012 --> 00:56.555
<i>but those anti-symbols are in the way.</i>

00:56.556 --> 01:01.977
<i>He'll be on guard against purification
spells and stick to anti-divine symbols.</i>

01:01.978 --> 01:06.815
<i>Divine sorcery is too delicate
and can't be mixed with other spells.</i>

01:06.816 --> 01:11.070
<i>He can only use three
different symbols at the same time...</i>

01:11.071 --> 01:13.739
Apologies for the wait, Master Lloyd!

01:13.740 --> 01:16.075
Hey, what is taking you so long?!

01:16.076 --> 01:19.286
I bet you're thinking of ways
to capture him alive!

01:19.287 --> 01:21.706
You mustn't show him any mercy!

01:23.458 --> 01:25.710
You two...

01:26.961 --> 01:28.463
What are you doing?!

01:30.173 --> 01:32.050
You seem to be taking it easy.

01:35.094 --> 01:38.847
Don't you hear the noises
mixed in this song?

01:38.848 --> 01:42.017
While I was telling you about my past,

01:42.018 --> 01:45.771
my chimeras are making their way
to stop this song.

01:45.772 --> 01:48.398
Are you sure you don't want to help them?

01:48.399 --> 01:49.609
I knew all along.

01:51.861 --> 01:53.863
Did you think I didn't know?

02:12.090 --> 02:13.883
You don't have to hold back.

02:17.887 --> 02:20.140
You can scream or roar.

02:20.640 --> 02:22.433
It won't ruin this song.

02:23.852 --> 02:25.854
You have a wonderful voice.

02:26.688 --> 02:30.400
We'll adjust to fit you in, Shiro!

02:56.092 --> 02:59.970
Does this sound
like noise to you, Guitane?!

02:59.971 --> 03:03.140
Then you're the one
who doesn't understand!

03:03.141 --> 03:06.603
Right, there's this one spell
I've been wanting to try.

03:10.940 --> 03:12.483
<i>I'm just a prince.</i>

03:13.651 --> 03:15.320
<i>Preposterous...</i>

03:16.154 --> 03:18.697
You'd better get them ready now, Guitane.

03:18.698 --> 03:20.240
<i>How can someone like this...</i>

03:20.241 --> 03:23.870
Ready your anti-symbols
for earth, water, and wind!

03:24.454 --> 03:27.457
<i>If someone like this is not a God,
then what is he?!</i>

03:33.171 --> 03:35.006
Triple Incantation.

03:45.391 --> 03:50.313
<i>I can only make three symbols
at the same time. In other words,</i>

03:50.897 --> 03:55.817
<i>if I created earth, water, and fire
anti-symbols like he told me to,</i>

03:55.818 --> 03:58.445
<i>I won't be able to
block a cleansing spell.</i>

03:58.446 --> 04:03.326
<i>So I absolutely
must not run out of symbols.</i>

04:03.826 --> 04:07.580
<i>That would be the worst defeat
that could happen to me.</i>

04:08.915 --> 04:13.503
<i>I'd rather die
than be turned good and taken alive.</i>

04:20.468 --> 04:23.471
Earth! Water! Wind! Excalibur!

04:29.060 --> 04:31.062
<i>Triple Incantation.</i>

04:33.523 --> 04:35.566
Glacia Krystacier!

04:52.875 --> 04:55.794
Thank you for blocking that, Guitane!

04:55.795 --> 04:57.713
This is too much, Master Lloyd!

04:57.714 --> 05:01.633
Like, absolutely way extra overboard!

05:01.634 --> 05:05.263
Are you crazy, Seventh Prince?!

05:05.930 --> 05:11.893
This is a spell that could destroy
the whole world and all of humanity!

05:11.894 --> 05:14.021
(How the sky looked from the surface)

05:14.022 --> 05:16.773
The rain suddenly turned into a blizzard?!

05:16.774 --> 05:19.901
Mom, look! The sky looks gross!

05:19.902 --> 05:22.070
God must be angry!

05:22.071 --> 05:24.031
The only one who could do this is...

05:24.032 --> 05:29.036
Hey, you're only calling me a Prince now?
Didn't you call me a God?

05:29.037 --> 05:33.291
God could never be anything like you!
A God is...!

05:34.208 --> 05:40.423
<i>Wait, am I still looking at God
with high expectations...?</i>

05:51.142 --> 05:52.310
Shiro!

05:53.311 --> 05:55.730
I'm sorry we took so long!

05:57.565 --> 06:02.110
What are you doing?
Aren't you on Guitane's side?

06:02.111 --> 06:04.197
And I was wondering why you're here.

06:04.739 --> 06:07.783
Who is Master Guitane fighting,
if not you?

06:07.784 --> 06:10.453
I mean, look at it. It's probably God.

06:12.455 --> 06:16.249
Someone with our standing went out
of control and provoked God's wrath.

06:16.250 --> 06:19.002
The world might as well end now.

06:19.003 --> 06:22.840
Perhaps so. How very unfortunate.

06:32.475 --> 06:34.726
What a weird lyric.

06:34.727 --> 06:37.229
She's just singing
whatever popped into her head!

06:37.230 --> 06:39.732
Yeah, but it's giving me strength!

06:40.566 --> 06:44.236
<i>Being innocent
means anything will be forgiven?</i>

06:44.237 --> 06:47.240
<i>How can such absurdity be the truth?!</i>

06:48.032 --> 06:51.326
<i>Then God, look at me...</i>

06:51.327 --> 06:53.745
<i>I have broken your taboos
and turned into a monster.</i>

06:53.746 --> 06:57.958
<i>I exploited those with regrets
and betrayed my friends.</i>

06:57.959 --> 07:01.462
<i>I even dragged little Anastasia
when she had done no wrong.</i>

07:02.630 --> 07:04.590
<i>I'm just like that raving, starving man.</i>

07:06.926 --> 07:10.596
<i>My pure, unbridled rage has led me here!</i>

07:11.848 --> 07:14.600
<i>Well? What will you say?!</i>

07:19.605 --> 07:22.358
<i>O God... Why...?</i>

07:23.234 --> 07:29.657
<i>Why won't you judge me?
How long will you disregard me? Please!</i>

07:32.452 --> 07:35.620
<i>And what about "That" thing?!
How is "That" okay?!</i>

07:35.621 --> 07:39.791
<i>His innocence is about to
destroy this whole world!</i>

07:39.792 --> 07:44.045
<i>Innocence is just evil
without self-awareness!</i>

07:44.046 --> 07:45.673
<i>How could...</i>

07:46.507 --> 07:49.050
<i>How could that be allowed?!</i>

07:49.051 --> 07:51.428
<i>There's nothing about it worth protecting!</i>

07:51.429 --> 07:55.683
<i>Nothing of it is worthy of exaltation!</i>

08:01.564 --> 08:02.690
Dad!

08:04.442 --> 08:07.152
Mom! Dad's back!

08:07.153 --> 08:10.697
Oh, you didn't get lost today?

08:10.698 --> 08:13.367
Mom, can I sing with Dad?

08:13.951 --> 08:16.871
Okay, we can all sing together!

08:18.539 --> 08:19.582
<i>Please...</i>

08:21.167 --> 08:22.710
<i>God...</i>

08:27.673 --> 08:30.259
<i>This is not fair...</i>

08:31.636 --> 08:32.929
I can't...

08:33.971 --> 08:35.848
Dad is awful at singing...

08:37.225 --> 08:39.519
Are you all right there?

08:40.228 --> 08:42.146
Don't you get lonely?

08:43.606 --> 08:47.442
<i>The days I purely denied purity itself...</i>

08:47.443 --> 08:52.365
<i>Means I was denying the days
of pure joy I had back then.</i>

08:53.449 --> 08:55.117
You're weird, Dad.

08:55.826 --> 08:58.246
We don't care if you can't sing.

09:00.248 --> 09:02.749
All right, looks like Dad's tired!

09:02.750 --> 09:03.793
Right!

09:04.752 --> 09:06.587
Charge!

09:14.136 --> 09:16.888
<i>He purposely went
straight in front of me...</i>

09:16.889 --> 09:21.143
<i>He really does indulge me to the end.</i>

09:22.270 --> 09:25.565
Seventh Prince!

09:25.856 --> 09:28.776
Luma Maxima!

09:33.364 --> 09:36.200
<i>Even after receiving my Luma Maxima...</i>

09:38.160 --> 09:41.581
<i>He didn't change a single bit...</i>

09:43.916 --> 09:46.043
Luma Maxima!

10:12.820 --> 10:14.487
It's warm...

10:14.488 --> 10:17.700
This snow is healing my wounds!

10:18.492 --> 10:22.203
<i>Was the cataclysm... reversed?</i>

10:22.204 --> 10:24.874
<i>Is this level of cleansing
even possible...?</i>

10:30.546 --> 10:33.132
It's raining again.

10:33.758 --> 10:36.677
The rain always follows me, after all.

10:37.345 --> 10:39.929
Perhaps heaven is crying.

10:39.930 --> 10:41.181
Surely not.

10:41.182 --> 10:45.185
I rather believe heaven is spitting on me.

10:45.186 --> 10:50.441
I doubt the sky will smile upon me
as long as I live.

10:53.694 --> 10:57.198
I'm sorry...

10:57.740 --> 11:00.325
I kept looking away...

11:00.326 --> 11:03.954
I blamed everything on God
and depended on you...

11:05.498 --> 11:07.208
If only it wasn't for me...

11:07.708 --> 11:10.711
If only I stopped it from happening...

11:11.253 --> 11:15.216
I am the one who brought you the rain...

11:17.468 --> 11:20.553
Damnit, this is why
I hate cleansing spells.

11:20.554 --> 11:23.432
People just start
spilling their hearts out.

11:27.395 --> 11:29.105
My bad, okay.

11:29.688 --> 11:31.440
Sorry I never noticed.

11:37.488 --> 11:40.533
<i>Looks like it's over, Lloyd.</i>

11:42.076 --> 11:44.953
Mom, I'm sorry for not finishing my food!

11:44.954 --> 11:47.831
I'm sorry I doodled on the walls!

11:47.832 --> 11:50.458
I'm sorry I broke Papa's vase.

11:50.459 --> 11:53.379
What?! Oh well, it's okay!

11:56.715 --> 11:58.634
I really can't tell.

11:59.135 --> 12:02.179
- Stay, stay.
- Did the spell actually work on you?

12:02.888 --> 12:06.267
Or is this how you always have been?

12:06.976 --> 12:12.273
You could've influenced
all the bishops to be your pawns.

12:13.107 --> 12:14.525
Why didn't you?

12:16.110 --> 12:18.528
Because I believed that
at this Advent Festival,

12:18.529 --> 12:21.656
If God does not descend and judge me,

12:21.657 --> 12:27.537
then one of them would come
to judge me in the name of God.

12:27.538 --> 12:32.293
I picked them as the strongest
envoys of righteousness.

12:32.793 --> 12:37.547
Had I defeated them,
or been defeated by them,

12:37.548 --> 12:40.050
then this battle would have meaning.

12:40.759 --> 12:43.052
It has to be an all-out fight.

12:43.053 --> 12:45.930
Otherwise, righteousness won't be upheld,

12:45.931 --> 12:49.977
and nothing would be denied.

12:51.187 --> 12:56.441
Yet the one who stopped me
was neither God nor a bishop.

12:56.442 --> 12:59.945
It was the seventh prince
and a sister of the church.

13:00.613 --> 13:01.947
How funny.

13:03.115 --> 13:07.953
I'm sure God resides
within her singing voice.

13:08.787 --> 13:10.247
Hey, Guitane.

13:11.207 --> 13:14.752
Do you know why Escher became a sister?

13:15.836 --> 13:18.839
Because I love to sing.

13:20.841 --> 13:24.802
No, I mean, I do respect God!

13:24.803 --> 13:29.098
It's just, you see,
singing is the only thing I'm good at.

13:29.099 --> 13:34.395
And people come to the church
to listen to songs.

13:34.396 --> 13:36.606
That's why you joined the church?

13:36.607 --> 13:41.861
B-But this Advent Festival is different!

13:41.862 --> 13:45.448
I'm getting back at that nasty priest!

13:45.449 --> 13:48.368
If there's a chance
he'll show up at the festival,

13:48.369 --> 13:50.412
then I cannot stay away!

13:53.874 --> 13:58.128
Hilarious, isn't it?
It has nothing to do with God at all.

13:58.921 --> 14:01.881
It's not about what's right or wrong.

14:01.882 --> 14:05.761
Sometimes, you can just pick
whichever is more fun.

14:07.388 --> 14:10.932
Like me, I'm always going after
all the fun things in my way.

14:10.933 --> 14:14.895
Not everyone can live
their way like yours.

14:16.814 --> 14:21.527
<i>Well, true, that was what cost me
my previous life.</i>

14:25.030 --> 14:26.282
I picked this up.

14:29.910 --> 14:33.789
What did he say in his last moments?

14:36.375 --> 14:37.543
I forgot.

14:39.753 --> 14:43.299
I'll be waiting for you
in Lordost, Guitane.

14:53.893 --> 14:56.145
<i>Tragic news befalls Saloum.</i>

14:57.146 --> 15:00.440
<i>Pope Guitane was murdered
by an unknown faction</i>

15:00.441 --> 15:02.818
<i>that is behind
the large-scale terror attack.</i>

15:03.986 --> 15:07.656
<i>The Pope's remains were discovered
in the terrorists' underground lab.</i>

15:08.824 --> 15:11.409
<i>An unknown man disguised himself
as the Pope</i>

15:11.410 --> 15:15.247
<i>and infiltrated the festival,
triggering the incident.</i>

15:18.042 --> 15:20.710
<i>Were they motivated
by their hatred of God?</i>

15:20.711 --> 15:24.298
<i>The man behind this incident
is yet to be identified.</i>

15:25.799 --> 15:27.717
What an outrage!

15:27.718 --> 15:30.970
What do you mean, "Yet to be identified"?!

15:30.971 --> 15:33.848
Pope Guitane is the culprit!

15:33.849 --> 15:35.975
Quiet down, Rozelis.

15:35.976 --> 15:39.021
Some bishops still don't know the truth.

15:39.730 --> 15:41.481
Keep your mouth shut.

15:41.482 --> 15:44.443
The church's reputation is at stake.

15:44.985 --> 15:47.236
If doubts in the teaching start to form,

15:47.237 --> 15:49.782
this country could fall along with it.

15:51.241 --> 15:53.493
But we can't just stay put.

15:53.494 --> 15:56.496
We need a new leader
who can guide the people!

15:56.497 --> 16:00.833
Since we have no other choice,
then I, Rozelis, shall be the next pope!

16:00.834 --> 16:02.503
Most definitely not you.

16:03.462 --> 16:05.755
We already have
a better person for the job.

16:05.756 --> 16:10.135
A charismatic person who has
the overwhelming support of the people.

16:11.428 --> 16:12.637
Whuh?

16:12.638 --> 16:18.143
I beg you, please take the trial
to become the pope.

16:19.770 --> 16:21.270
Who?

16:21.271 --> 16:23.022
You.

16:23.023 --> 16:24.649
W-Why...?

16:24.650 --> 16:28.528
Because we want you to be the next pope!

16:28.529 --> 16:34.368
Eeeeeeeehhh?!

16:58.559 --> 17:02.438
<i>Sometimes my little brother
just appears in my room.</i>

17:03.188 --> 17:06.483
<i>Perhaps the fact that I don't ask
anything is a good thing for him.</i>

17:09.778 --> 17:15.325
Sorry, I did knock,
but you seemed to be having fun.

17:15.826 --> 17:19.872
Lloyd, I remember you said
something back at the church.

17:21.248 --> 17:26.377
A large-scale uprising might happen
during the Advent Festival.

17:26.378 --> 17:29.672
When that happens,
I believe that your and Escher's music

17:29.673 --> 17:32.885
could greatly affect
the outcome of the battle.

17:34.303 --> 17:37.930
When you feel that the town
is at its loudest,

17:37.931 --> 17:39.892
I want you to start your performance.

17:40.559 --> 17:42.186
I'll prepare a stage for it.

17:43.896 --> 17:44.938
Why?

17:47.232 --> 17:49.359
Why am I the only one
you're telling this to?

17:50.778 --> 17:51.779
Because...

17:52.905 --> 17:56.909
If I told anyone else, they'd say
it's too dangerous and stop it.

17:57.451 --> 17:58.910
That's true.

17:58.911 --> 18:00.204
<i>We're different.</i>

18:01.914 --> 18:03.414
So, how was it?

18:03.415 --> 18:05.918
Was the show up to your liking?

18:07.169 --> 18:11.256
<i>We both know that we would
sacrifice ourselves for our obsessions.</i>

18:11.924 --> 18:15.301
Yes! It was a fantastic performance!

18:15.302 --> 18:18.180
<i>We're abnormals
with something we love too much.</i>

18:19.389 --> 18:21.934
You did great too, Shiro!

18:23.393 --> 18:25.394
You're a good boy! A strong boy!

18:25.395 --> 18:27.439
You did well too.

18:38.784 --> 18:40.493
<i>A spell stack?!</i>

18:40.494 --> 18:45.457
<i>She's recreating my spell through music,
and by just playing by ear?!</i>

18:46.208 --> 18:51.213
You heard me when I was in the sky...?

18:51.839 --> 18:55.591
No, I mean, I was hiding the whole time!

18:55.592 --> 18:57.927
There's no way I know anything about...

18:57.928 --> 18:59.470
Lloyd.

18:59.471 --> 19:02.891
We had a lot of fun
at the Advent Festival, didn't we?

19:03.559 --> 19:05.978
<i>I don't need to ask anything further.</i>

19:06.603 --> 19:09.189
<i>Just as he doesn't bother me.</i>

19:10.357 --> 19:12.568
<i>I won't bother him.</i>

19:13.819 --> 19:20.742
<i>I enjoy these moments,
where we abnormals are left undisturbed.</i>

19:25.998 --> 19:28.917
Where's the girls' bath?!

19:30.627 --> 19:33.212
This is Lordost's newest attraction,

19:33.213 --> 19:35.882
a place to wash away the toils
of one's mind and body!

19:35.883 --> 19:41.263
The only one allowed
in the mixed bath is Prince Lloyd himself!

19:44.266 --> 19:49.187
Become the pope and guide the people?

19:49.188 --> 19:50.981
It's too much for me...

19:51.732 --> 19:54.192
It does sound like a great responsibility.

19:54.193 --> 19:57.069
But it's amazing!
They wanted you to become the pope!

19:57.070 --> 19:58.738
You're being silly here.

19:58.739 --> 20:02.783
Once you become one, you're hardly
able to meet the guys you like.

20:02.784 --> 20:04.702
What did Babylon say?

20:04.703 --> 20:07.663
He just said, "I see..."

20:07.664 --> 20:11.918
Wait, why are you bringing up Babylon?!

20:11.919 --> 20:15.672
<i>I'd be sad if I can't see Lloyd anymore...</i>

20:16.590 --> 20:18.549
How bittersweet.

20:18.550 --> 20:21.177
Both Sylpha and Ren
are obsessed with Lloyd, too.

20:21.178 --> 20:22.845
I-It's not like that!

20:22.846 --> 20:26.599
Besides, you set up a contest
on who could go on a date with Lloyd!

20:26.600 --> 20:29.936
T-That was because
I just wanted to tease you two!

20:29.937 --> 20:31.938
Sylpha...

20:31.939 --> 20:33.814
Can I leave now?

20:33.815 --> 20:35.359
No.

20:36.193 --> 20:38.694
- W-Why is Lloyd here?!
- W-Why is Lloyd here?!

20:38.695 --> 20:41.197
<i>Haven't we done this before?</i>

20:41.198 --> 20:43.241
Lloyd...

20:43.242 --> 20:47.662
At this rate, they're going to pick me
as the pope. What should I do...?

20:47.663 --> 20:49.205
That so?

20:49.206 --> 20:54.585
If you keep ignoring me,
then I'll nominate you as the new pope!

20:54.586 --> 20:56.713
W-Why would you do that?!

20:58.382 --> 21:02.969
I know you played a big role
during the investigation of this case.

21:02.970 --> 21:06.973
Prince Albert was boasting about that
to Bishop Dante, you know?

21:06.974 --> 21:09.475
<i>- That stupid brother!
- That stupid brother!</i>

21:09.476 --> 21:11.185
You may not!

21:11.186 --> 21:14.647
Prince Lloyd will be living
a peaceful life with me at the palace!

21:14.648 --> 21:17.066
He will not become a showpiece!

21:17.067 --> 21:18.568
A showpiece?!

21:21.571 --> 21:24.241
A showpiece...?

21:25.242 --> 21:28.744
That sounds like
the perfect job for you, Escher.

21:28.745 --> 21:30.747
Saria...

21:31.081 --> 21:34.001
That's not Escher, that's a rock.

21:36.128 --> 21:37.421
Do you remember?

21:38.088 --> 21:41.882
After I performed
at the cathedral one day...

21:41.883 --> 21:44.593
Please perform with me!

21:44.594 --> 21:45.846
No.

21:47.973 --> 21:50.474
Perform with me!

21:50.475 --> 21:55.354
You followed me every day
and asked me to do a duet with you.

21:55.355 --> 21:59.234
Yes, I really wanted to sing with you.

22:00.152 --> 22:04.864
Your performance always draws
a huge crowd,

22:04.865 --> 22:09.161
so if I can make them all
happy with my song...

22:09.745 --> 22:12.497
That would make me very happy as well.

22:15.751 --> 22:19.754
So you wanted to use me and the church
as a stepping stone?

22:19.755 --> 22:22.049
N-No! Not at all!

22:25.010 --> 22:27.012
You won't be just singing to a crowd.

22:27.554 --> 22:31.850
Your song will ring throughout the world.

22:39.524 --> 22:42.277
That is, if you take on
the platform as the pope.

22:43.695 --> 22:45.780
Saria...

22:45.781 --> 22:49.242
That's not Escher, that's a duck.

22:50.702 --> 22:54.164
<i>I see, she's right.</i>

22:54.915 --> 22:56.958
<i>A place where everyone can hear...</i>

23:02.255 --> 23:03.840
<i>My Song!</i>
